      "confidence": 0.94
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The drawing adds XOR logic that drives the Nutrient-A stepper direction from labeled Trojan signals, creating a risk of unintended pump reversal. It also wires the LiDAR interface to power and I2C despite the specification stating that PR1 is unwired."
}

